{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/313687-gadget-help","id":313687,"title":"Gadget Help","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-16T08:06:57-08:00","id":313687,"title":"Gadget Help","content":"I wanted to make a gadget that would use a near by source of electricity to do AGG damage. So lets say I'm in a subway rather then the normal amount of electricity going through the device it would be the third rails electricity going through it. Conversely if I am near a weak source it is lower damage. <br /> <br /> I wanted to know how I would go about making this which exploit or embed would I use in this gadget ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-16T09:32:47-08:00","id":313780,"title":"","content":"The thing about gadgets is that prerequisites are fluid and largely between the Storyteller and the player. Electricity usually isn't aggravated damage though, so it comes across as more of an exploit than an embed. Off hand, I'd use Murder by Improbability as the prerequisite for making the gadget.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3755-jaerys","name":"Jaerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-16T14:12:55-08:00","id":313946,"title":"","content":"Murder by improbably would make sense for targeted lightning strikes instead of the path of least resistance but if you get a DF you just might be the one hit.<br /> <br /> What you'd need to think of is 1) what hardware works? 2) is the limitation that it can only be harm by electricity and from a present source 3) what would the activation be and 4) would it make sense for the dicepool to change.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T13:07:45-08:00","id":316471,"title":"","content":"I agree that murder by improbability is a good prerequisite, but if you want it to do AGG I think you need to do it as a lambda with Hellfire as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T15:10:41-08:00","id":316553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seidmadr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/313687-gadget-help?p=316471#post316471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree that murder by improbability is a good prerequisite, but if you want it to do AGG I think you need to do it as a lambda with Hellfire as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd think making a Lambda is overkill for what the original poster wants to accomplish. I would think a Hellfire Near Field Gadget would be enough to turn an electricity source into an all destroying aggravated weapon, especially as electricity and fire are already related physically and the power does not give the ability to control the electricity.<br /> <br /> Unrelated, but a Murder by Improbability/Hellfire Lambda could give people bad luck resulting in horribly messy deaths. Maybe I would even remove the restriction that it doesn't work on supernaturals out of combat, as it is a Lambda that incorporates an exploit and should be worth the horrible danger of creating it. So making the third rail inflict aggravated would be the least this power could do. The downside would be that there would be no way of deciding how the death will occur, and that the messiness and unlikeliness of the death could raise atention.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":304,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/304-penta","user":"Penta","date":". 11-19-2014, 06:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/304-penta","name":"Penta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar304_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"617"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T05:36:41-08:00","id":317313,"title":"","content":"hmmmm that sounds good","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}